Local changes to thu-ml/SageAttention (https://github.com/thu-ml/SageAttention, Apache-2.0) at commit
d1a57a546c3d395b1ffcbeecc66d81db76f3b4b5, made in August 2026 for the Qwen3.8 Sage attention backend: they let the
headers build without PyTorch (SAGEATTN_STANDALONE) and add the masks and strides Qwen3.8 needs. The changed files
remain under SageAttention's Apache-2.0 license.

ggml/src/ggml-cuda/qwen38-sage-attention.cu includes ../../../../SageAttention-reference/csrc/qattn/
qk_int_sv_f8_cuda_sm89.cuh, i.e. ../SageAttention-reference seen from the repository root, so the build needs that
checkout beside the repository (QWEN38_27B.md, "Build (Linux)"). In a checkout of that commit:
git apply sageattention-d1a57a5-qwen38.patch

